{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120308","id":3864839474,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7mXMUy","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120308","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120308.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120308.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120308","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120308/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120308/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120308/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/4b0c9b1e6057ea4a906dac446c832023511a3391","number":120308,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Preprocess shader code before passing it to `get_shader_type()`","user":{"login":"mechalynx","id":8427257,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0MjcyNTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8427257?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mechalynx","html_url":"https://github.com/mechalynx","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mechalynx/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mechalynx/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mechalynx/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mechalynx/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mechalynx/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mechalynx/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mechalynx/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mechalynx/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mechalynx/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- Closes #120197\r\n\r\nIdeally all code given to `ShaderLanguage::get_shader_type()` would be preprocessed inside the function, as it would cover all possible code paths, but I didn't in order to minimize changes and to avoid creating a `ShaderPreprocessor` object every time it's called. Instead I added preprocessing to code it recieves on paths that need it.\r\n\r\n(Edit - I wrote the fix that changes `get_shader_type()` instead anyway - here it is: https://github.com/mechalynx/godot/commit/a461148bc745af49fdb5268dd4ebb69b281b01d6. I didn't remove any cases where preprocessed code is already fed to `get_shader_type()` because the only case I know if is from here godotengine/godot#79287 and I would be effectively reverting it)\r\n\r\nI've only tested with the MRP since the changes are limited in scope.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\n * Though with this change `_get_first_ident_pos()` does redundant comment skipping, this should be kept for cases where `get_shader_type()` is called on non-preprocessed code.\r\n\r\n * Related to the above, currently none of the built-in default shaders are passed through a preprocessor. This isn't an issue now but if there are ever default shaders with preprocessor directives prior to `shader_type`, those parts of the code will also have the same bug.\r\n\r\n * I didn't add any extra error checking in case the preprocessor fails. That's because I saw other parts of the code do the same and I'm honestly not sure where to throw an error this deep in the code.\r\n\r\n * This is mostly unrelated but while searching for issues and PRs related to `MaterialStorage` because I wasn't sure what it did (it's a code path related to this PR's fix), I came across godotengine/godot#116203 which fixes a race condition for the RD version of `MaterialStorage` but the GLES3 and Dummy versions don't seem to have that fix. I don't understand enough to know if this is a problem or warrants opening an issue for it.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1609442062,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNjA5NDQyMDYy","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:shaders","name":"topic:shaders","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":10951989861,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAACjMoaZQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/cherrypick:4.7","name":"cherrypick:4.7","description":"Considered for cherry-picking into a future 4.7.x release","color":"446699","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"http